{
  "t": "save",
  "name": "stat-line",
  "desc": "Up to six short text facts in ONE low flex row, no buttons (the corner x closes it): fits the thin strip below or above the active window. Pass /t1 .. /t6 as ready-made strings such as \"Cost today $4.20\"; leave unused ones empty.",
